&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Established in 2004, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OLIVER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is the world’s first and only specialist in designing, building, and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands. We partner with over 300 clients in 40+ countries and counting. Our unique model drives creativity and efficiency, allowing us to deliver tailored solutions that resonate deeply with audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt; Global Head of Analytics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt; London, United Kingdom&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;(2-3 days a week from our London offices)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Global Head of Analytics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; to lead one of the most important practices in our business. This is a senior leadership role with genuine scope; you&#39;ll own a global team of around 80 people, spanning audience insight, creative performance analytics, social listening and measurement, search marketing and paid social, all embedded within in-house client teams across Europe, APAC, LATAM and North America.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Reporting to&amp;nbsp;OLIVER’s&amp;nbsp;Chief Strategy Officer,&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;sit at the intersection of creativity,&amp;nbsp;technology&amp;nbsp;and data.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;help&amp;nbsp;OLIVER and our clients understand not just&amp;nbsp;what&#39;s&amp;nbsp;performing, but&amp;nbsp;why, and what to do next.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;spearhead&amp;nbsp;new solutions&amp;nbsp;in driving creative&amp;nbsp;effectiveness, and&amp;nbsp;proving the value of&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;creative&amp;nbsp;component&amp;nbsp;of our clients’ marketing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You’ll&amp;nbsp;work closely with&amp;nbsp;Brandtech&amp;nbsp;colleagues in&amp;nbsp;packaging&amp;nbsp;and scaling Group data solutions to drive&amp;nbsp;more value from marketing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;also play a&amp;nbsp;key&amp;nbsp;role, with your&amp;nbsp;Brandtech&amp;nbsp;colleagues,&amp;nbsp;in shaping how our proprietary Gen AI platform, Pencil, is powered by data and insight;&amp;nbsp;making&amp;nbsp;it smarter,&amp;nbsp;faster&amp;nbsp;and more impactful for the clients who rely on it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This is a role for someone who is as comfortable in a client boardroom as they are in a product sprint. Someone who can inspire a globally distributed team, spot commercial opportunity and&amp;nbsp;translate complex data into stories that help businesses make better decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the global analytics practice&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership to a globally distributed team of ~80 analysts and insight specialists, with six direct reports across disciplines and regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and sustain a high-performance, collaborative team culture across a diverse, multi-disciplinary group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and continuously evolve OLIVER&#39;s analytics methodologies, tools and frameworks across search, paid social, social listening, audience insight and measurement — ensuring best practice is shared and applied globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the team has the engineering capability to integrate data sources and build automated solutions at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion data and insight as a strategic differentiator — internally at OLIVER and externally with clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive commercial growth&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the analytics revenue line, accountable for delivering 10% year-on-year growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and develop new commercial opportunities: expanding services within existing client relationships and contributing to new business pitches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with senior client stakeholders to demonstrate and quantify the value of data-led decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior analytics partner and thought leader for key clients — particularly on creative effectiveness, audience understanding and performance measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive meaningful improvement in client satisfaction, targeting a five-point improvement in client NPS in year one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and launch new products&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with data and technology leaders across the Brandtech Group to co-develop proprietary data products and analytics capabilities, with a focus on the creative effectiveness space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package and position Brandtech&#39;s data assets in ways that are compelling and value-driving for OLIVER&#39;s clients — particularly at the intersection of media, creativity and agentic commerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the scaling of OLIVER&#39;s Gen AI-enabled data products, including trend and competitor reporting tools and automated social reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale OLIVER&#39;s creative effectiveness measurement approach into a differentiating, client-facing capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embed Gen AI at the heart of insight&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a central role in ensuring Pencil, Brandtech&#39;s proprietary Gen AI platform, is optimally enabled by data and insight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay at the frontier of Gen AI developments relevant to marketing analytics — bringing new ideas and applications into the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with OLIVER&#39;s wider leadership team to embed AI-powered insight into client workflows and content ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape group-wide data strategy&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with Brandtech Group data leaders, contributing to group-wide thinking on data strategy and product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead thinking on how media, creativity and data come together — and how LLM recommendation and agentic commerce will reshape content ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you need to be great in this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant senior leadership experience in analytics, data strategy or a related discipline, ideally within a creative or media agency, platform, or technology business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building and scaling high-performing, multi-disciplinary analytics teams in a global or multi-market context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable success growing revenue and commercialising data or insight propositions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and launching data products or insight tools, ideally in collaboration with technology partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with the marketing analytics landscape: performance measurement, audience insight, social listening, search, paid social and creative effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional strategic thinking — the ability to connect data to business outcomes in ways that resonate with C-suite and board-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial instincts: experienced in identifying, shaping and closing revenue opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication and storytelling skills — able to make complex data feel clear, relevant and actionable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead and inspire distributed, culturally diverse teams across multiple time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in navigating and influencing complex, matrixed organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sets the AI strategy for the analytics discipline across OLIVER&#39;s global portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine fluency in Gen AI and its applications in marketing and data — including hands-on experience building agents and agentic workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops AI capability across teams and client offerings; embeds AI-powered insight into client workflows at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads governance and quality standards for AI-assisted analytics across the practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributes thought leadership on AI&#39;s role in data, creativity and marketing — internally across Brandtech and externally in the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountability for the analytics revenue line and year-on-year growth targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and presenting commercial propositions from data and insight capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;P&amp;amp;L management experience across multiple markets or business lines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of presenting financial performance to executive and board-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Formal qualifications are welcome but not required. Equivalent experience counts. Experience can be gained through work, independent research, or professional practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Req ID:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt; 17877&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-KA1 #LI-Hybrid #LI-director&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our values shape everything we do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Ambitious&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to succeed &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Imaginative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to push the boundaries of what’s possible &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Inspirational&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to do groundbreaking work &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;always learning and listening&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to understand &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Results-focused &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;to exceed expectations &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;actively pro-inclusive and anti-racist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; across our community, clients and creations  &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our recruitment process does not employ artificial intelligence. Candidate evaluation and selection are conducted without AI-supported screening or decision-making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;OLIVER,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;a part of the Brandtech Group, is an equal opportunity employer committed to creating an inclusive working environment where all employees are encouraged to reach their full potential, and individual differences are valued and respected. All applicants shall be considered for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, neurodivergence, disability status, or any other characteristic protected by local laws. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; OLIVER has set ambitious environmental goals around sustainability, with science-based emissions reduction targets. Collectively, we work towards our mission, embedding sustainability into every department and through every stage of the project lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Established in 2004, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OLIVER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is the world’s first and only specialist in designing, building, and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands. We partner with over 300 clients in 40+ countries and counting. Our unique model drives creativity and efficiency, allowing us to deliver tailored solutions that resonate deeply with audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt; Account Director - 12 Month Fixed Term Contract&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt; London, United Kingdom &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As Account Director,&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;own the client relationship and the delivery engine. Working across&amp;nbsp;brand&amp;nbsp;campaigns, always-on digital content, thought leadership and, event&amp;nbsp;and marketing&amp;nbsp;collateral,&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;be accountable for account health, project governance, stakeholder alignment, and commercial performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:300,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on senior role that demands both strategic thinking and operational discipline.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;shape the partnership at a senior level while managing briefs, pipelines, compliance&amp;nbsp;and brand&amp;nbsp;workflows, and budgets with rigour and confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:300,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Client Partnership &amp;amp; Account Leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the senior client relationship as primary point of contact for the client&#39;s marketing&amp;nbsp;and communications&amp;nbsp;team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Translate business priorities into clear studio direction and creative briefs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Chair status meetings, monthly business reviews, and strategic planning sessions, keeping the studio positioned as a high-value partner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage client expectations through competing priorities and regulated timelines, without compromising relationships or output quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proactively&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;opportunities to grow the scope of the partnership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Project Management &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end delivery across the full creative portfolio,&amp;nbsp;from brief intake through production, approvals, and final output,&amp;nbsp;across digital, social, print, events, and long-form content&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Maintain full pipeline visibility, managing SLA frameworks, capacity risks, and project status across all in-flight work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
