&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b50ef6a2-66ae-4438-a3a7-72fcbe88cfc4&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1634&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dbfe8ea4c3ed&quot;&gt;3+ years of experience managing technical support teams in a data center or similar critical infrastructure environment.&lt;/p&gt;
