&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot; data-local-id=&quot;795a79f9-641b-4a0b-899e-2f62fc5bcce2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
