&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is Tenable?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tenable® is the Exposure Management company. Over 40,000 organizations around the globe rely on Tenable to understand and reduce cyber risk. Our global employees support 65 percent of the Fortune 500, 50 percent of the Global 2000, and large government agencies. Come be part of our journey!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes Tenable such a great place to work?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ask a member of our team and they’ll answer, “Our people!” We work together to build and innovate best-in-class cybersecurity solutions for our customers; all while creating a culture of belonging, respect, and excellence where we can be our best selves. When you’re part of our #OneTenable team, you can expect to partner with some of the most talented and passionate people in the industry, and have the support and resources you need to do work that truly matters. We deliver results that exceed expectations and we win together!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Localization Engineer, Applied AI is a pivotal technical lead role responsible for the next-generation evolution of Tenable&#39;s established multilingual delivery infrastructure. This role requires a dual focus: providing strategic architectural direction while maintaining hands-on expertise in multilingual content engineering, system integration, and workflow automation. This is a unique opportunity to evolve our global content delivery platform — scalable and optimized for integrating AI-led technologies — accelerating the global delivery of multilingual content&lt;br&gt;across Tenable&#39;s international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Sr Director of Globalisation, you will serve as the primary technical authority for the team, while evolving a system architecture that achieves tangible productivity outcomes through AI-led automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the shift from automated to AI-led localization: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the evolution of AI/LLM-led workflows built for accelerated, simultaneous multi-language releases, focusing on product UI first.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gradually extend the AI-led pipeline model across the content stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Take the principles proven in the product UI pipeline and, working with partner engineers, apply to other content areas — online documentation, marketing, and beyond, scale a consistent, AI-led delivery approach across Tenable&#39;s international content ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape standards and governance: &lt;/strong&gt;Define high-standard technical best practices, system hygiene norms, and engineering documentation that the wider team can build on as you are leading through the shift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build intelligence into operations: &lt;/strong&gt;Complement existing reporting with AI-powered reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead, build and orchestrate: &lt;/strong&gt;Own hands-on delivery of key initiatives while directing contracted and distributed engineering partners on others — with the judgment to know which work to keep close and which to delegate effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building at the frontier of AI-led localization — which means the landscape shifts fast, and so do we. We value curiosity and a genuine drive to learn at least as much as specific tool experience. Strong foundations plus the energy to grow are highly valued. Here is what we are looking for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-forward mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re energized by the pace of change in AI tooling, follow new&amp;nbsp;developments actively, and bring that curiosity into your engineering work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience integrating LLMs (ideally Claude/Anthropic) and&amp;nbsp;agentic steps into engineering workflows — building reliable, production-grade AI&amp;nbsp;pipelines and programmatic model improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to design event-driven, API-first translation infrastructure — where content from repos, CMS platforms, and databases flows automatically into translation engines, triggered by code commits, content changes, or release events. This also includes web and content delivery workflows such as CMS-driven and proxy-based localization solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internationalization &amp;amp; Localization engineering: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong i18n/l10n engineering&lt;br&gt;awareness — string externalisation, relevant frameworks, and deep familiarity with localization file formats and encoding conventions across content types.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translation Management Systems: &lt;/strong&gt;Solid understanding of TMS principles -Translation Memory, Machine Translation, and next-generation integration frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD and DevOps&lt;/strong&gt; frameworks and principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong scripting ability &lt;/strong&gt;(Javascript, Python, Regex).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Solutions that generalise across content types and delivery channels where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder communication: &lt;/strong&gt;Comfortable bridging engineering and non-engineering colleagues — linguists, project managers, developers, architects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation discipline: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong documentation habits — knowledge transfer is built into the role from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Distributed team collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Able to work effectively with distributed teams across multiple geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AV1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re committed to promoting Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) at Tenable - through all equal employment opportunity laws and regulations at the international, federal, state and local levels.&amp;nbsp; If you need a reasonable accommodation due to a disability during the application or recruiting process, please contact&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- for further assistance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tenable Data Consent Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tenable is committed to protecting the privacy and security of your personal data. Depending on your location, one or more of the following notices may apply to you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_General_Applicant_Privacy_Notice_FINAL_4-29-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;General Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_CCPA_Notice_Applicants_FINAL_4-29-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_EEA_UK_Applicant_Privacy_Notice_FINAL_6-4-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EU/EEA/UK Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-top.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;RELEX Solutions is looking for talents, innovators and people who really want to get stuck in and make a difference. People like you! RELEX Solutions is a leading international software company with Finnish roots. Our cloud-based platform optimizes retail and supply chain processes across all industries - from DIY, pharmaceuticals and FMCG to manufacturing and our specialty (food) retail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;And as an employer? At RELEX, not only the optimization of trade is our top priority, but also our employees. You benefit from a high degree of autonomy, flat hierarchies, diverse development opportunities and a working environment in which we pay particular attention to the compatibility of professional and private life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We are looking for a&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Solution Consultant (m/f/*)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CPG / Manufacturing&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team. We&#39;re looking for an experienced professional with a passion for using the latest technologies – including machine learning – to optimize our customers&#39; supply chains and mentor the next generation of consultants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be joining a highly skilled team of consultants, taking a leading role in shaping solutions, driving best practices, and contributing to the growth of the team. You&#39;ll work closely with both our customers and in-house teams to deliver innovative, creative solutions at scale. The role requires deep expertise in supply chain business processes and software configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead customer engagements to define business objectives and translate them into strategic planning solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Drive cross-functional collaboration to architect and deliver tailored supply chain solutions that measurably improve customer profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end integration of our product with clients&#39; existing systems and processes, ensuring scalability and long-term fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Oversee rigorous testing and quality assurance to ensure solutions meet the highest standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Act as a trusted advisor, guiding customers in maximizing the value of our product and championing continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Provide senior-level support for critical incidents and lead value-driven development initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Mentor and coach junior consultants, sharing expertise and raising the overall capability of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring to the table:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A relevant academic background (e.g., Business, Engineering, Supply Chain Management, Computer Science, Data Analytics, or related fields).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Extensive professional experience in solution design, consulting, supply chain operations, or software implementation, ideally within SaaS or ERP/Planning systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in manufacturing operations with a comprehensive understanding of planning and scheduling challenges at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Advanced data analytics, critical thinking, and problem-solving skills; strong proficiency with SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A strong track record of leading complex implementations, including testing, quality assurance, training, and user adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with demonstrated ability to influence at all levels of an organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A proactive, adaptable mindset with proven ability to manage multiple priorities and lead in a fast-changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Fluency in English is required; German is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer in return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be supported and given the space to thrive. We offer meaningful work, flexibility, and a culture that backs you to share your voice and be authentic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;An international career and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A rapidly growing and financially robust software company with exciting opportunities for career growth, also in the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These are the RELEX key benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Flexible working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Genuine work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Internet and mobile phone benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Diverse, inclusive, and supportive work culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Meaningful work with a commitment to a more sustainable future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;High autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Room for creativity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Strong team spirit through company parties, two team days per year, and after-work activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Family-oriented policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Flat hierarchies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Two paid volunteering days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Interested? Please apply with your full application documents, salary expectations, and earliest possible start date using the button below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We value diversity and welcome applications from all backgrounds—regardless of gender, nationality, ethnicity, social background, religion, disability, age, sexual orientation, or identity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;To learn more about RELEX, visit relexsolutions.com. For questions about the application process, feel free to contact us at&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current&quot; ---------- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-bottom.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;We are Axicom, part of WPP, an award-winning global communications agency for tech-driven brands. We bring together a diverse team of PR professionals passionate about integrated communications and telling the transformative stories of technology. With offices in the Netherlands, United States, United Kingdom, Spain, Italy, Germany, France, Sweden, Brazil, and Mexico, we are the largest global agency specializing in tech communication.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re proud to be recently recognized as Agency of the Future, Disruptive Agency of the Year, and Best PR Network to Work For (EMEA). This underscores our commitment to innovation, growth, and fostering a collaborative culture. Since 1994, we&#39;ve delivered ground-breaking campaigns for the world&#39;s most innovative tech companies, and we are always seeking new talent to join our team of Futurists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;Hyperlink SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Underlined SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;More about the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are an award-winning team of PR pros who are proud to be PRovoke’s Technology Agency of the Year in 2025 at the EMEA Sabre Awards. We bring together a diverse group of people who share a passion and deep understanding of the technology landscape and tech storytelling and we are looking for new talent to join our team. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Axicom&amp;nbsp;delivers communication campaigns for some of the world’s most innovative technology companies. From offices in Amsterdam, Austin, Los Angeles, London, Madrid, Milan, Munich, New York, Paris, San Francisco, and Stockholm,&amp;nbsp;Axicom&amp;nbsp;designs, builds, and delivers ground-breaking and thought-provoking campaigns. We offer our clients PR consultancy, creative strategy, media relations,&amp;nbsp;influencer engagement, content, digital marketing, and integrated communications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Senior Account Executive at Axicom, you will work with leading consumer&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;technology businesses who are shaping how we live and work.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;This role is perfect for an ambitious individual a few years into their PR career, who is looking to become a consumer technology specialist. You’ll be working with a team launching the latest smartphones and fitness tech products and delivering creative press office and campaign stories across gaming and smart home brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;looking for someone who&amp;nbsp;has a passion for the tech space,&amp;nbsp;so if you are a gamer, a gadget nerd or just someone who loves working in the consumer tech landscape this is the role for you. Someone who loves the thrill of securing coverage in today’s media landscape,&amp;nbsp;is always reading the newest&amp;nbsp;substack&amp;nbsp;or hunting out the latest YouTuber for their&amp;nbsp;clients,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;enjoys&amp;nbsp;heading to trade shows across the world and who has the attention to detail and creative mindset to&amp;nbsp;deliver&amp;nbsp;stand out&amp;nbsp;events, experiences&amp;nbsp;and campaigns&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;wants to be part of a team&amp;nbsp;that always goes the extra mile.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are an agency of Futurists not Followers, so if you are top of your game, ambitious and&amp;nbsp;wanting to work with people who are looking to the future of comms now. This is the role for you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our London Office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Axicom&amp;nbsp;has a significant presence in London, as one of our global office locations, enabling us to deliver ground-breaking campaigns for our clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Media relations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own media relationships with consumer technology,&amp;nbsp;lifestyle&amp;nbsp;and national press, be a go to in the team for the press we need to be speaking to, building on relationships you already have and&amp;nbsp;establishing&amp;nbsp;new ones.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;have a good bank of contacts and want to&amp;nbsp;grow this further.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
