&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;r23xzt&quot; data-start=&quot;1671&quot; data-end=&quot;1878&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design and deliver cloud-native data platforms using AWS, Azure or GCP, leveraging modern automation and approved AI-assisted engineering tools where appropriate to improve delivery quality and efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;11w51hf&quot; data-start=&quot;1879&quot; data-end=&quot;2076&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive the integration of data governance, metadata management, cataloguing, privacy and security capabilities, ensuring solutions align with regulatory requirements and responsible AI principles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1jc0z4x&quot; data-start=&quot;2077&quot; data-end=&quot;2278&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to clients, translating complex technical concepts into business outcomes while collaborating with multidisciplinary teams across architecture, engineering, analytics and AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
