&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;alhvb9&quot; data-start=&quot;2629&quot; data-end=&quot;2827&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with cloud ecosystems (AWS, Azure or GCP), modern data platforms and architectural best practices, alongside an openness to AI-enabled engineering approaches where appropriate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
