&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jl38aj&quot; data-start=&quot;1513&quot; data-end=&quot;1704&quot;&gt;Deliver enterprise-ready solutions on &lt;span class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/span&gt;, applying modern engineering practices and AI-enabled development approaches where appropriate to improve delivery efficiency and code quality.&lt;/li&gt;
