&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3514&quot; data-end=&quot;3889&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2dvy0w&quot; data-start=&quot;3514&quot; data-end=&quot;3591&quot;&gt;Deliver high-impact technology solutions for Tier 1 financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a87gyn&quot; data-start=&quot;3592&quot; data-end=&quot;3664&quot;&gt;Work in a collaborative, flat, and entrepreneurial consulting culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bsqn1d&quot; data-start=&quot;3665&quot; data-end=&quot;3733&quot;&gt;Access continuous learning, training, and industry certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19cv5mp&quot; data-start=&quot;3734&quot; data-end=&quot;3803&quot;&gt;Be part of a team shaping the future of digital financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16f0ika&quot; data-start=&quot;3804&quot; data-end=&quot;3889&quot;&gt;Help shape the future of digital transformation across Financial Services &amp;amp; Energy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;asdj0h&quot; data-start=&quot;3891&quot; data-end=&quot;3906&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3894&quot; data-end=&quot;3906&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3908&quot; data-end=&quot;4008&quot;&gt;We offer a competitive, people-first benefits package designed to support every aspect of your life:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4010&quot; data-end=&quot;5063&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sfk404&quot; data-start=&quot;4010&quot; data-end=&quot;4133&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4012&quot; data-end=&quot;4030&quot;&gt;Core Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health insurance, life insurance and critical illness cover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yaj5pw&quot; data-start=&quot;4134&quot; data-end=&quot;4236&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4136&quot; data-end=&quot;4154&quot;&gt;Mental Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Easy access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations, and in-house first aiders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pqxiiz&quot; data-start=&quot;4237&quot; data-end=&quot;4398&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4239&quot; data-end=&quot;4259&quot;&gt;Family-Friendly:&lt;/strong&gt; Maternity, adoption, shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause, and bereavement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nwru6l&quot; data-start=&quot;4399&quot; data-end=&quot;4497&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4401&quot; data-end=&quot;4417&quot;&gt;Family Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Eight complimentary backup care sessions for emergency childcare or elder care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jxn220&quot; data-start=&quot;4498&quot; data-end=&quot;4616&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4500&quot; data-end=&quot;4524&quot;&gt;Holiday Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Five weeks of annual leave with the option to buy or sell holiday days based on your needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;yr1gep&quot; data-start=&quot;4617&quot; data-end=&quot;4844&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4619&quot; data-end=&quot;4643&quot;&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Your growth, your way—minimum 40 hours of training annually through workshops, certifications, and e-learning. You&#39;ll also be assigned a Business Coach from day one to support your career development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ymgary&quot; data-start=&quot;4845&quot; data-end=&quot;4900&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4847&quot; data-end=&quot;4869&quot;&gt;Healthcare Access:&lt;/strong&gt; Convenient online GP services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ehztlg&quot; data-start=&quot;4901&quot; data-end=&quot;5063&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4903&quot; data-end=&quot;4919&quot;&gt;Extra Perks:&lt;/strong&gt; Wellhub (Gympass), travel insurance, Tastecard, season ticket loans, Cycle to Work, and dental insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;13k4p8o&quot; data-start=&quot;5065&quot; data-end=&quot;5090&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;5068&quot; data-end=&quot;5090&quot;&gt;Inclusion at Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5092&quot; data-end=&quot;5585&quot;&gt;We&#39;re committed to making our recruitment process accessible and straightforward for everyone. If you need any adjustments at any stage, just let us know—we&#39;ll be happy to help. We value each person&#39;s unique perspective and contribution. At Capco, we believe that being yourself is your greatest strength. Our &lt;strong data-start=&quot;5402&quot; data-end=&quot;5423&quot;&gt;#BeYourselfAtWork&lt;/strong&gt; culture encourages individuality and collaboration—a mindset that shapes how we work with clients and each other every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5092&quot; data-end=&quot;5585&quot;&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Senior AI Product Manager - Product &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Product &amp;amp; Experience | &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Shape meaningful products that improve customer outcomes across financial services and energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Senior Product Manager within Capco’s Product &amp;amp; Experience practice, you will define, build, and scale AI-enabled products and experiences. You will translate emerging AI capabilities into real-world value, working closely with clients and cross-functional teams to deliver products that are commercially impactful, user-centric, and production-ready within complex, regulated environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will also&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;as an AI-enabled Product Manager,&amp;nbsp;leveraging&amp;nbsp;modern AI tooling to accelerate discovery, decision-making, and delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead product engagements across clients and Capco teams, embedding AI into both product strategy and delivery workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Define and deliver AI-native product strategies, including value propositions, roadmaps, and commercialisation models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own products end-to-end, from discovery through delivery and iteration, incorporating rapid experimentation, prototyping, and AI-assisted development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Identify, shape, and prioritise AI/GenAI/agentic/ML use cases, translating them into scalable product features and measurable business outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner closely with data science and engineering teams to bring ML models and AI systems into production, balancing performance, risk, and cost&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Champion responsible AI by embedding governance, explainability, and regulatory considerations into product design and lifecycle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mentor and lead multidisciplinary teams, fostering a culture of experimentation, learning, and AI &amp;amp; data fluency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience in developing and delivering digital products/portfolios across B2B, B2C, or B2B2C contexts within financial services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deep knowledge in one or more of the following: retail banking, commercial banking, wealth management, asset management (across advisory, discretionary, or execution-only models), capital markets, investment banking, insurance, or energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proven experience building or scaling AI, data, or platform-enabled products, including exposure to GenAI or LLM-based applications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to define and deliver AI-driven use cases that create measurable impact (revenue, efficiency, engagement)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong leadership skills, including working with multidisciplinary teams and senior stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Track record&amp;nbsp;in driving commercial impact, with experience in user adoption, value creation, and sustainable growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience working with data-led or platform products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Understanding of AI, GenAI, or agentic AI concepts and their product applications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Consulting experience within highly regulated industries&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Experience with agentic AI systems, copilots, or workflow automation products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Familiarity with AI governance, model risk management, and regulatory expectations (e.g. in financial services)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-impact product and experience solutions for leading financial services and energy organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a collaborative, flat, and entrepreneurial consulting culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access continuous learning, training, and industry certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a practice shaping the future of digital products and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow your career in a global consultancy that values inclusion and individuality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health insurance, life insurance and critical illness cover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Easy access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations, and in-house first aiders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-Friendly:&lt;/strong&gt; Maternity, adoption, shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause, and bereavement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family Care:&lt;/strong&gt; 8 complimentary backup care sessions for emergency childcare or elder care.&lt;/li&gt;
